module Core

### Immutable-share discipline. The guarded data is never mutated, so no lock is needed: a
### `Shared[T, ReadOnly]` grants only read access (`Inspecting[T]`), and `ReadOnly` is a zero-sized
### record, so the controller's `lock` field adds no overhead. This is the default discipline.
### :see: {LockPolicy}, {Shared}
record ReadOnly obeys LockPolicy
  pass
